{"id":"7a465cae4692d50e","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-Lomega1omega.md","title":"L {ω₁ω}","display":"df-Lomega1omega — L_{ω₁ω}","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-Lomega1omega","aliases":["57-df-Lomega1omega"],"display":"df-Lomega1omega — L_{ω₁ω}","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]","[[57-df-assignment]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-Lomega1omega"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-Lomega1omega</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-Lomega1omega — L_{ω₁ω}"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-Lomega1omega-—-$L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$\">df-Lomega1omega — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\omega_1\\omega}\">\\(L_{\\omega_1\\omega}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>背景理论为 ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为本册一阶总字母表，原子公式与一阶赋值满足关系见依赖文件。无穷公式是良基语法树：原子、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\theta\">\\(\\neg\\theta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\\Psi\">\\(\\bigwedge\\Psi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee\\Psi\">\\(\\bigvee\\Psi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\theta\">\\(\\forall x\\theta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\theta\">\\(\\exists x\\theta\\)</span> 为互不混同的单射构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span> 为子公式集合，不是字符串。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi&lt;\\omega_1\">\\(\\xi&lt;\\omega_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda&lt;\\omega_1\">\\(\\lambda&lt;\\omega_1\\)</span> 为极限序数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 在原子处沿用一阶定义。保留原允许可数多个自由变量的语法，不暗加“每个公式自由变量有限”的条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_\\infty\">\\(\\models_\\infty\\)</span> 是本文件递归语义，涉及无穷公式时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 缩写它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nF_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\\\\nF_{\\xi+1}&amp;\\coloneqq F_\\xi\\cup\\{\\neg\\theta:\\theta\\in F_\\xi\\}\\cup\\{\\bigwedge\\Psi,\\bigvee\\Psi:\\Psi\\subseteq F_\\xi,\\ |\\Psi|&lt;\\aleph_1\\}\\cup\\{\\forall x\\theta,\\exists x\\theta:x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\theta\\in F_\\xi\\},\\\\\nF_\\lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}F_\\xi,\\qquad L_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\omega_1}F_\\xi.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nF_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\\\\nF_{\\xi+1}&amp;\\coloneqq F_\\xi\\cup\\{\\neg\\theta:\\theta\\in F_\\xi\\}\\cup\\{\\bigwedge\\Psi,\\bigvee\\Psi:\\Psi\\subseteq F_\\xi,\\ |\\Psi|&lt;\\aleph_1\\}\\cup\\{\\forall x\\theta,\\exists x\\theta:x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\theta\\in F_\\xi\\},\\\\\nF_\\lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}F_\\xi,\\qquad L_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\omega_1}F_\\xi.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\alpha)\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\neg\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\bigwedge\\Psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\theta\\in\\Psi}\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta),\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\bigvee\\Psi)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\theta\\in\\Psi}\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(Qx\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\theta\\in L_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S):\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\alpha)\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\neg\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\bigwedge\\Psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\theta\\in\\Psi}\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta),\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\bigvee\\Psi)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\theta\\in\\Psi}\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(Qx\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\theta\\in L_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S):\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\neg\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\bigwedge\\Psi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\theta\\in\\Psi\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\bigvee\\Psi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta\\in\\Psi\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\forall x\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x]\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\exists x\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x]\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\Phi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\theta\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\Phi\\models_\\infty\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\Phi\\to\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\theta).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\neg\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\bigwedge\\Psi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\theta\\in\\Psi\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\bigvee\\Psi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta\\in\\Psi\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\forall x\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x]\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\exists x\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x]\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\Phi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\theta\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\Phi\\models_\\infty\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\Phi\\to\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\theta).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\land\\eta\\coloneqq\\bigwedge\\{\\theta,\\eta\\},\\quad\\theta\\lor\\eta\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\{\\theta,\\eta\\},\\quad\\theta\\to\\eta\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\{\\neg\\theta,\\eta\\},\\quad\\theta\\leftrightarrow\\eta\\coloneqq(\\theta\\to\\eta)\\land(\\eta\\to\\theta)\\quad(\\theta,\\eta\\in L_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta\\land\\eta\\coloneqq\\bigwedge\\{\\theta,\\eta\\},\\quad\\theta\\lor\\eta\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\{\\theta,\\eta\\},\\quad\\theta\\to\\eta\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\{\\neg\\theta,\\eta\\},\\quad\\theta\\leftrightarrow\\eta\\coloneqq(\\theta\\to\\eta)\\land(\\eta\\to\\theta)\\quad(\\theta,\\eta\\in L_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>以可数序数阶段给出实际最小闭包，避免对全部闭合类直接作未定义集合交。空合取、空析取的语义分别由全称、存在空集量词决定。二元连接在无穷语法中是集合构造的缩写，不改动一阶语法的原始连接构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-Lomega1omega-—-$L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$","text":"df-Lomega1omega — $L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"d5f7158a321b8947","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L_{\\omega_1\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi<\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda<\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nF_0&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\\\\nF_{\\xi+1}&\\coloneqq F_\\xi\\cup\\{\\neg\\theta:\\theta\\in F_\\xi\\}\\cup\\{\\bigwedge\\Psi,\\bigvee\\Psi:\\Psi\\subseteq F_\\xi,\\ |\\Psi|<\\aleph_1\\}\\cup\\{\\forall x\\theta,\\exists x\\theta:x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\theta\\in F_\\xi\\},\\\\\nF_\\lambda&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi<\\lambda}F_\\xi,\\qquad L_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi<\\omega_1}F_\\xi.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\alpha)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\alpha)\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\neg\\theta)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\bigwedge\\Psi)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\theta\\in\\Psi}\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta),\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\bigvee\\Psi)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\theta\\in\\Psi}\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(Qx\\theta)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S)&\\coloneqq\\{\\theta\\in L_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S):\\mathrm{FV}_\\infty(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\alpha&\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\neg\\theta&\\leftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\bigwedge\\Psi&\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\theta\\in\\Psi\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\bigvee\\Psi&\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta\\in\\Psi\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\forall x\\theta&\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x]\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\exists x\\theta&\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x]\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\theta&\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\Phi&\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\theta\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\theta),\\\\\n\\Phi\\models_\\infty\\theta&\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\Phi\\to\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\theta).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta\\land\\eta\\coloneqq\\bigwedge\\{\\theta,\\eta\\},\\quad\\theta\\lor\\eta\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\{\\theta,\\eta\\},\\quad\\theta\\to\\eta\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\{\\neg\\theta,\\eta\\},\\quad\\theta\\leftrightarrow\\eta\\coloneqq(\\theta\\to\\eta)\\land(\\eta\\to\\theta)\\quad(\\theta,\\eta\\in L_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S)).","display":true}],"bytes":3899,"backlinks":[{"id":"384c24ae38b35244","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\kappa\\ge\\lambda\\ge\\aleph_0$ 为无限基数；$\\kappa^+$ 是后继基数，$\\xi<\\kappa^+$，$\\eta<\\kappa^+$ 为极限序数。$S$ 为本册字母表；语法采用 [[57-df-Lomega1omega]] 的带标签良基树。对无穷长度的互异变量列 $\\vec x:\\delta\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}$，$\\delta<\\lambda$，加入互不混同的块量词构造子；有限块按从右到左迭代普通一元量词，空块为恒等。原可数变量池不扩大。$\\mathrm{Quant}$ 是以下构造操作的类。"},{"id":"ce9bc26a71a11644","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为可数字母表，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S)$，语法与语义见 [[57-df-Lomega1omega]]。$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$、$\\mathfrak A\\models_\\infty\\varphi$ 且 $\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\\ge\\aleph_0$。"},{"id":"c9100690e3f1db16","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_\\varphi,S_\\psi$ 为 $S$ 的两个子字母表，具有一致符号种类与元数；交集继承这些分区并包含共同的变量及逻辑字母。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\varphi)$、$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\psi)$，见 [[57-df-Lomega1omega]]。在并字母表结构上假定 $\\{\\varphi\\}\\models_\\infty\\psi$；子字母表句子的求值先作约化。"},{"id":"e4d9ab0f9e9545c9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 的唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$；$S'$ 在 $S$ 上加入两列互异新常量 $(c_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$、$(d_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$。$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$；集合合取、析取及句子语义取 [[57-df-Lomega1omega]]。$\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}$ 下式指定载体恰由 $d_n$ 枚举且序型为 $\\omega$，不是声称一般良基性可由一个无穷句子定义。$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S')$。作为 [[57-df-compactness-property]] 的语义表示，$L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$ 的句子域为 $\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}$，真值取 $\\models_\\infty$。"},{"id":"ecf842768c6ea96e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为可数字母表，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$ 且 $\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\\le\\aleph_0$。$\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S)$ 与 $\\models_\\infty$ 取 [[57-df-Lomega1omega]]；$\\cong$ 见 [[57-df-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012